# NOTE: upstream's .gitignore ignored *.auto.* because Inkscape/Blender
# regenerated them at `make files` time. We commit the prebuilt assets
# under img/ so Parcel can build without Inkscape/Blender (Ripley pivot
# plan §2 Phase A, "no asset edits in v1").
!img/*.auto.png
!img/*.auto.glb
